    {
      "abstract": "This table shows the correlation coefficient between the $\\alpha_{\\mathrm{\\overline{K}^0 n}}$ and $\\alpha_{\\pi \\Sigma}$ parameters extracted from the different fits to the K$^-$ p correlation function with free weights. The results are shown as a function of the core radius $r_{\\mathrm{core}}$ shown in Table 7. The error on the correlation coefficient, shown as statistical errors in the table, are obteined by using the Pearson's formula to evaluate the probable error of correlation coefficient.",
